":"announcement","title":"0.6.0","summary":"Balance & Bug FixesIncreased the delay between throwing a bomb and the Mine Slave's follow-up action when the player is within its detection range. This was originally intended behavior, but the formula used to determine the Mine Slave's action cooldown had been incorrect.Fixed a bug that could allow the Coyote to perform a double jump by quickly redirecting toward the ground immediately after jumping.Now player's attacks can be canceled by jumping.Known IssuesWhen enemies overlap, there is an i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T04:51:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951295790","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348370-1840944183776074","game_id":"steam-4348370","kind":"announcement","title":"New Localization Languages Added!","summary":"The following four languages have been added.简体中文繁體中文Español (Latinoamerica)Português (Brasil)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T08:15:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183776074","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348370-1839676055896830","game_id":"steam-4348370","kind":"announcement","title":"0.5.9","summary":"Visual Effects & BalanceThe windup time for some enemy attacks has been extended, and a flashing telegraph effect has been added. As a result, the perceived difficulty of fighting enemies affected by this change has decreased.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-04T08:34:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055896830","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348370-1839676055894036","game_id":"steam-4348370","kind":"announcement","title":"0.5.82","summary":"SystemImproved elevator usability.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T07:33:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055894036","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348370-1839676055892620","game_id":"steam-4348370","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.5.81","summary":"System & BalanceSpamming guard repeatedly now makes it a bit harder to block enemy attacks.Is this finally the end for the infamous giant sewer rat?Resting at a Recovery Statue will now save your location. The reason there wasn't an Angel Statue in that area was related to planned map design for the full game, including shortcuts and such — but regardless, in the current demo build, that was just pointless harshness. After weighing various feedback, we decided it would be better to provide a sav","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-02T13:30:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055892620","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348370-1839676055892032","game_id":"steam-4348370","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.5.8","summary":"BalanceLonely Joëlo's health, attack power, and stamina have been slightly decreased.Giant Rat's attack power has been significantly decreased.Schakatsna the Plunderer's attack power and stamina have been slightly decreased.Stholcarad the Slave Warden's stamina has been slightly decreased.Hemlon's stamina damage reduction on successful deflection has been increased.OtherFixed an issue where Lonely Joëlo's name displayed with a different meaning only in Korean.Added a tooltip indicating that stam","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-02T05:41:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055892032","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348370-1839676055884031","game_id":"steam-4348370","kind":"update","title":"0.5.7 Update (Added on July 30, 2026)","summary":"System & BalanceEnemies now require a short delay before they begin recovering Stamina.If an midair attack is canceled by landing before hitting an enemy, a normal ground attack will now be performed instead.Midair attacks that do not target an enemy performing a low attack no longer deal Stamina damage.Added on July 30, 2026Improved combat when enemies are cornered, making fights in tight spaces smoother.VisualsHemlon's Stamina gauge now gradually turns red as her Stamina decreases. This effect","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T02:36:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055884031","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4348370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:49Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:48Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4348370":"2026-10-26T02:11:49Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4348370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:48Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:48Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4354580":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4348370","app_id":4348370,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:34Z","source_